OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CToday:FA dry morning with variable     
OL,6,Fcloud and sunny spells after a frosty  
OL,7,Fstart. Cloudier in the afternoon as    
OL,8,Fscattered showers spread southwards,   
OL,9,Fbut still some good dry and bright or  
OL,10,Fsunny spells, especially in the south. 
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy in the        
OL,13,Fevening and overnight with showers     
OL,14,Ffeeding in from the north, perhaps     
OL,15,Fheavier near northern coasts but       
OL,16,Flighter with longer dry spells in the  
OL,17,Fsouth.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
